WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.319 --> 00:00:04.360
Hello, and welcome to this introductory class

2
00:00:04.360 --> 00:00:06.440
into Lighten inside of Unreal Engine 5.

3
00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:09.439
My name's James Burton, and I'm an Unreal Engine instructor.

4
00:00:09.439 --> 00:00:11.119
I'll be guiding you through this course

5
00:00:11.119 --> 00:00:14.400
and covering a wide variety of topics regarding Lighten.

6
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:16.760
We'll be going through Lighten terminology.

7
00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:18.960
We'll be going through the differences between baked

8
00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:20.559
lighting and lumen.

9
00:00:20.559 --> 00:00:22.760
We'll also be looking at Nanite and virtual shadow

10
00:00:22.760 --> 00:00:26.910
maps, as well as some baked lighting setups

11
00:00:26.910 --> 00:00:28.429
that we can take a look at in order

12
00:00:28.429 --> 00:00:31.989
to have a good holistic view of how lighting works inside

13
00:00:32.030 --> 00:00:35.270
Unreal Engine and what the options are available to us.

14
00:00:35.270 --> 00:00:38.829
So I hope you enjoy it, and let's get started.
